+Generated with the built-in image generation tool. All images generated fresh from text without image references.
+
+285-hilda.png
+
+Generate ONE fresh square 1024x1024 illustration from text only, with no reference images. Use case: illustration-story. Hilda (Luke Pearson)-style illustration, fully native to that visual language: flat graphic shapes, clean confident outline, radically simplified cartoon anatomy, Scandinavian folklore and expansive storybook staging, muted teal and burnt orange palette with restrained mustard. WIDE FULL-BODY LANDSCAPE SCENE inside a square canvas: a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater sits on a low mossy boulder in an open Nordic woodland clearing, cheerfully sipping coffee from a little mug; a croissant rests nearby on the rock. A tiny wood man stands next to her and an enormous gentle mythical elk creature towers behind the dark stylized pine silhouettes, its antlers branching into the sky. The woman is small in the composition so the creature's incredible scale and the patterned forest dominate. Illustrate the woman's curls, glasses, freckles and knitted sweater economically within the flat graphic language. Cozy curious folklore mood, large negative spaces, crisp shape edges, graphic overlapping layers. Let the style dictate proportions and spatial logic. Absolutely no photorealism, no photographic lighting, no photo filter, no 3D rendering, no text, captions, letters, signatures, logos or watermarks.
+
+286-hugo-pratt.png
+
+Generate ONE fresh square 1024x1024 illustration from text only, with no reference images. Use case: illustration-story. Hugo Pratt / Corto Maltese-style adventure comic drawing: masterful fluid black brush ink, extremely economical expressive line, sudden solid black shapes, loose transparent watercolor washes and broad unpainted paper. An intimate OFF-CENTER SHOULDER-UP PROFILE of a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and mustard-yellow knit sweater, wearing a simple sailor cap. She stands at a Venetian harbor cafe ledge, brings a tiny espresso cup to her lips and gazes thoughtfully across the water; a croissant lies on a saucer at the near lower edge. The harbor opens diagonally behind her: a few expressive masts, mooring posts, gondola silhouettes and pale Venetian facades conveyed with very sparse ink strokes. Adventurous, windswept, contemplative maritime mood. Asymmetrical crop, sophisticated elongated comic proportions, strong expressive profile, auburn hair defined by gestural black curls and a few rust washes, subdued watery blue-green harbor, ochre sweater. Allow watercolor bleeds, dry-brush breaks and intentional unfinished paper to form the image. Authentic drawn comic art, never a photograph with a filter. No text, speech balloons, captions, sound effects, letters, signatures, logos or watermarks.
+
+287-tezuka.png
+
+Generate ONE fresh square 1024x1024 manga illustration from text only, with no reference images. Use case: illustration-story. Osamu Tezuka classic 1950s-60s manga style, round simple features, enormous sparkling eyes, rounded rubber-hose anatomy, charming bold black contours, clean expressive gestural cartoon drawing, black and white with gray screentones only. DYNAMIC LOW-ANGLE THREE-QUARTER FULL-FIGURE composition: a cheerful woman in her early 30s with shoulder-length curly auburn hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater is enjoying a cup of coffee as she sits on a high round cafe stool, her legs and the stool angled into the foreground. She smiles warmly at a small friendly robot boy hovering beside her on rocket boots, short rounded body, large expressive manga eyes, glossy black hair and mechanical boot cuffs with tiny stylized exhaust flames. A croissant on a small floating-looking round cafe tabletop sits within her reach, beside the stool. Simple playful retro futuristic cafe scenery in minimal linework; sweeping diagonal motion lines around the little robot and generous white areas. The woman's adult identity remains clear despite the appealing simplified manga proportions. Hair auburn, tortoiseshell frames and mustard sweater must be translated to distinctive monochrome tones and limited knit marks, absolutely no actual color. Authentic mid-century manga artwork; let the graphic style govern the entire scene. Single illustration, no panels-with-text. No text, letters, speech balloons, captions, sound effects, signatures, logos or watermarks.
+
+288-stick-figure.png
+
+Create a square 1024x1024 minimalist xkcd-like stick-figure webcomic as a complete OPAQUE WHITE PAPER IMAGE. Every background pixel must be solid white, never transparent. Draw sparse black stick lines on this solid white background. A single unbordered panel, huge blank white margins. Near the lower center, a woman is a real stick figure: single-line legs and arms, simple round head, loose squiggly shoulder-length curly hair outline, round glasses, three freckle dots, small outlined trapezoid for a knitted sweater. Her character is a woman in her early 30s with auburn curls, tortoiseshell glasses, and mustard sweater, but all are represented in purely black outlines to suit the stark monochrome webcomic style. She happily drinks coffee through a ridiculously long curly straw from a tiny mug held high by a laboratory stand on a very simple stick-line table. A small crescent croissant is beside the stand. A wordless absurd coffee experiment, drawn with very few black pen lines. Single-line limbs, no realistic anatomy or shaded illustration. No text, labels, symbols, numbers, captions, signature or watermark. NO TRANSPARENCY: solid opaque pure white canvas all the way to all four edges. Generate entirely fresh from text; no reference image.

